msgid "![An image of a quantum circuit diagram with many layers indicating that the circuit must be evaluated for many different unitary operators in order to perform the modified, efficient Hadamard test.](/learning/images/courses/quantum-diagonalization-algorithms/krylov/kqd-fig6.avif)\n"
